   The store needed per window (TYP): median 982.4 Wh, the largest 2174.5 Wh; the model's store of the 4S21P kit 692.1 Wh.
   'Several times more energy': the illustrative targets need 1.42 to 2.54 times the 4S21P kit's usable store, and 1.52 to
   2.71 times its 84 cells.
   Assumptions: WE's inputs (conditional on the three undocumented efficiencies); 400 Wp; the load as in A; the store grown on
   the lid's side with U3B's code 62 charge current unchanged; a full store at each window's start; the percentile is over
   overlapping windows of 16 Septembers, not independent trials.

